o/mp4\"></video></span><br>Once the money is flowing, buy hardware that runs your schemes faster. But it's not just about the hardware: get a new smartphone, a geeky figurine, fancy outfits for your cat. Hell, you can even buy yourself an aloe.<br><br><strong>Fun fact:</strong> this is more or less what machine learning specialists actually do. Now you can become one of them (minus the salary). <strong>while True: learn()</strong> is the best game about being a data scientist, because nobody else has been weird enough to make one.<br><br>Playable with a mouse alone or with a controller, including on Steam Deck. Available in more than 30 languages.",
